-    _inherit = ['analytic.mixin', 'res.currency.rate.consolidation.mixin']

Total Changes: 248

[REF] product,account,*: simplify catalog logic

The catalog was historically developed for the `sale.order` (and `sale.order.line`)
models.

It was later on re-used for account moves and purchase orders, then
for stock models (mrp productions and work orders, ...).

In 19.0, it was enhanced to handle sections update (SO, PO, AM).

...

All those changes accumulated some inconsistencies and technical complexity.

This commit factorizes the logic duplicated in the different models as much as
possible, it also introduces a clean `product.catalog.line.mixin` that now
formalizes the methods expected on the 'line' model, and factorizes the default
behavior.

Note that the current commit (and PR) only focuses on the backend logic of the
catalog, the client side logic will require more work and will (hopefully) be done
in the near future.

